ical society dedicated to providing comprehensive guidelines and recommendations for critical care nutrition and metabolic support, particularly for patients who are neurocritical and polytraumatized. The organization has developed specialized recommendations for nutritional approaches in clinical settings, focusing on the management of nutritional needs in critically ill patients, including those with severe burns. SEMICYUC plays a crucial role in collaborating on guidelines that enhance the nutritional support provided to critically ill patients, ensuring that healthcare professionals have access to the best practices in critical care nutrition.", "BILIOGRAFÍA:The bibliography lists various studies and guidelines related to nutritional support for critically ill patients, emphasizing the importance of tailored nutritional strategies.", "TCE:TCE, or traumatic brain injury, is a significant medical condition that affects millions of individuals globally each year, leading to considerable rates of death and disability. Recovery from TCE necessitates specific nutritional interventions tailored to support the unique metabolic needs of patients. These nutritional strategies are essential for promoting healing and optimizing recovery outcomes in those affected by this serious condition.", "HERRERO MESEGUER I:Herrero Meseguer I is a co-author of guidelines for nutritional support in critical care, focusing on neurocritical patients.", "CONEJERO GARCIA-QUIJADA R:Conejero Garcia-Quijada R is a contributor to the recommendations for nutritional support in critically ill patients, emphasizing the importance of tailored nutrition.", "BLES MALPICA AL:Blesa Malpica AL is an author of updated recommendations for nutritional support in critically ill patients, particularly those who are polytraumatized.", "GARCIA DE LORENZO Y MATEOS A:Garcia de Lorenzo y Mateos A is a co-author of guidelines for nutritional support in critically ill patients, focusing on artificial nutrition in polytraumatized patients.", "MESEJO ARIZMENDI A:Mesejo Arizmendi A is an editor and contributor to guidelines on clinical nutrition and dietetics, particularly in special situations.", "SINGER P:Singer P is a co-author of the ESPEN Guidelines on Parenteral Nutrition, which provide recommendations for intensive care nutrition.", "ACOSTA ESCRIBANO J:", "PACIENTE SÉPTICO:El paciente séptico es un individuo que presenta una respuesta inflamatoria sistémica a una infección, lo que requiere un tratamiento nutricional específico.", "HIPERMETABOLISMO:El hipermetabolismo es un estado metabólico en el que se movilizan sustratos energéticos como hidratos de carbono y lípidos para mejorar la función inmune y la reparación tisular.", "HIPERCATABOLISMO:El hipercatabolismo es un proceso en el que se utilizan proteínas como sustrato energético, lo que puede llevar a una rápida degradación y pérdida de nitrógeno."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}